@startuml
title Activity Diagram - Support Chat

|Customer|
start
:Open chat support;
:Type message;
:Store chat message;
if (Message for AI support?) then (AI)
  :Forward message to AI handler;
  :Generate AI response;
else (Staff)
  :Route message to staff inbox;
endif

if (Response available?) then (Yes)
  :Broadcast response to recipient;
  :Display chat reply;
else (No)
  :Return chat error;
  :Show retry notice;
endif

if (Socket disconnected?) then (Yes)
  :Queue or fail gracefully;
  :Show connection status;
endif
stop
@enduml
